{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking up in a deep, dark forest, the two follow an unidentified girl into an old hospital. They must avoid enemies in the labyrinth, find a diary, reveal their hidden past, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-player cooperative play</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/4e09e8a670b5e5444d0b480453e6c579.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/4e09e8a670b5e5444d0b480453e6c579.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/4e09e8a670b5e5444d0b480453e6c579.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wear different masks with friends and work together with different abilities to avoid enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits can hear things that are not heard or further away, and owls can see things that are invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map that changes every time</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/3d4a09538457fd057bdd3ee716521420.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/3d4a09538457fd057bdd3ee716521420.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/3d4a09538457fd057bdd3ee716521420.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex labyrinths are randomly repositioned with each play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding the way is very difficult, so you can feel like you're wandering in a real mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Enemies</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/467fc7585fd8887b6369954fd5abffb9.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/467fc7585fd8887b6369954fd5abffb9.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/467fc7585fd8887b6369954fd5abffb9.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are several monsters in the labyrinth, such as wandering monsters, monsters that suddenly pop out of hiding. Survive by running away from various monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Items</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/934d5c3c942c7022240f2cf53e43b90c.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/934d5c3c942c7022240f2cf53e43b90c.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/934d5c3c942c7022240f2cf53e43b90c.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various items hidden in cabinets, drawers, and bookshelves to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items that fit the situation and survive for a long time</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Forest and the Hospital","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693270/98c71b76add2f0b964f6cab0f5b65dae09f115cb.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Within the Hospital","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693270/b2728005bcb2436b0ebfffaf730054bccd96831f.jpg"},{"name":"A bloodied school","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693270/7800be294bbe69a5c126680fffe20783768d31c6.jpg"},{"name":"Corridors and Crossroads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693270/d86595f174ca34cc63cf0d7361cf4a7f7909e491.jpg"},{"name":"Father and Daughter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693270/eabe9350af3c3757ab70839cf9a05c8ecfb88cac.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693270?t=1755030498","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693270?t=1755030498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/37c9092602220e2a669780a48cc122dbe7919f84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755030498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/37c9092602220e2a669780a48cc122dbe7919f84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755030498","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p clas